      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-27T22:18:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If host-command plans continue, I think this structure will ultimately contain the same information as the host command parameters, so I\u0027ll go ahead and reuse that struct definition and protect it with a mutex.",
      "parentUuid": "4435f69c_e9254731",
